flowchart LR
    Tap([Find Match]) --> Queue[POST /api/lobby/join]
    Queue --> Wait[Server holds for 2nd user]
    Wait --> Sub[Client subscribes /hubs/lobby]
    Wait --> Validate{Validate state?}
    Validate -->|ok| Start[Hub broadcasts GameStarting]
    Validate -->|bad| Refuse[Disconnect with reason]
    Start --> Loop[60fps loop]
    Loop --> Send[SendRealtimeInput]
    Send --> HubChk{Hub validates}
    HubChk -->|ok| Echo[Broadcast to opponent]
    HubChk -->|bad| Reject[Error to caller]
    Echo --> Render[Render opponent move]
    Render --> Loop
    Reject --> Loop
    Echo -.drop.-> Reconnect[Reconnect w/ backoff]
    Reconnect --> Sub
    Refuse --> End([Cleanup])